---
// Hero.astro: Cyberpunk Home Banner
---

<section class="hero-section" aria-label="欢迎首屏">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="hero-badge-dot"></span>
      <span>Generative AI & Mathematics Research</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">EntropyXi 的技术笔记</h1>

    <p class="hero-description">
      聚焦<strong>深度学习</strong>、<strong>扩散模型</strong>、<strong
        >流匹配 (Flow Matching)</strong
      >与<strong>数值分析</strong>的严谨数学推导与工程实践。
    </p>

    <div class="hero-chips">
      <span class="hero-chip"># 扩散模型</span>
      <span class="hero-chip"># 流匹配与 CNF</span>
      <span class="hero-chip"># SDE / ODE</span>
      <span class="hero-chip"># 图像超分辨率</span>
      <span class="hero-chip"># 数值计算</span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#latest-posts" class="hero-btn hero-btn-primary">
        <span>探索文章</span>
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="16"
          height="16"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M12 5v14"></path>
          <path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/archives/" class="hero-btn hero-btn-secondary">
        <span>归档体系</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/about/" class="hero-btn hero-btn-secondary">
        <span>关于作者</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 3.5rem 0 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--color-accent-subtle);
  }

  .hero-badge-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--color-accent-glow);
  }

  .hero-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .hero-description {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .hero-description strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .hero-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-chip {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-muted-soft);
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color var(--transition-normal),
      color var(--transition-normal),
      border-color var(--transition-normal),
      box-shadow var(--transition-normal),
      transform var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .hero-btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent-contrast);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--color-accent-glow);
  }

  .hero-btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: var(--color-accent-contrast);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--color-accent-glow);
  }

  .hero-btn-secondary {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .hero-btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (width <= 48rem) {
    .hero-section {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-description {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
